# Files excluded from the search index (same syntax as .gitignore).
# Eval gold sets map queries to their answers — indexing them contaminates
# the very rankings they measure.
# Anchored to the repo root: a bare "eval/" would also exclude src/eval/ —
# the engine's own eval module — from the index (a real bug the gold set
# itself caught: eval-metrics/eval-runner queries missed because the module
# was never indexed).
/eval/
